        "Debt mutual funds bought now are generally taxed at your slab on the gain, whatever the holding period.",
        "Section 80C (old tax regime) lets you deduct up to ₹1.5 lakh a year for things like ELSS funds, PPF, EPF and life-insurance premiums. ELSS has a 3-year lock-in.",
